OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' crash survivor to scale
OL,4,AHelvellyn peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who survived a "life-changing"
OL,7,Fcar accident has challenged himself to
OL,8,Fscale England's third-highest mountain
OL,9,Fto raise money for the team who saved
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,FSam Kirby, 31, from Gloucester, was
OL,13,Fdriving home after a holiday in the
OL,14,FLake District in November 2024 when the
OL,15,Fcollision occurred.
OL,17,FThe crash saw a multi-agency emergency
OL,18,Fresponse, including police, fire
OL,19,Fservice, the North West Ambulance
OL,20,FService, and the Great North Air
OL,21,FAmbulance Service (GNAAS).
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
